                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the recent hospital admission of your 33-year-old male patient, admitted on 05/12/2020 with confirmed SARS-CoV-2 infection. On admission, he presented with fever, dry cough, and progressive dyspnoea. Chest X-ray and CT confirmed bilateral pneumonia. Blood tests revealed elevated inflammatory markers. Oxygen saturation was reduced, requiring supplemental oxygen therapy. He was treated with dexamethasone, anticoagulation, and supportive intravenous fluids. Vital signs and oxygen saturation were monitored closely throughout the stay. Arterial blood gas analyses were performed serially. Physiotherapy was initiated to support respiratory recovery. The patient showed steady clinical improvement and was discharged on 19/12/2020 in a recovering condition. Please ensure follow-up within two weeks, including repeat chest imaging and pulmonary function assessment. Should you have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact me.</div>
               </text>
